---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="mx-auto flex min-h-[calc(100vh-64px)] max-w-6xl items-center px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="mb-5 text-sm font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-indigo-400 uppercase">
        Frontend Engineer · Builder
      </p>

      <h1 class="text-5xl leading-tight font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-7xl">
        Building products
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-400 to-cyan-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          with code.
        </span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-zinc-400">
        专注现代前端架构、工程化、性能优化以及 AI Agent 应用开发，在这里记录我的技术实践和思考。
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex gap-4">
        <a
          href="/blog"
          class="rounded-full bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-black transition hover:bg-zinc-200"
        >
          Read Blog
        </a>

        <a
          href="/projects"
          class="rounded-full border border-white/10 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium transition hover:bg-white/5"
        >
          View Projects
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
